# Obelisk stub (items.md Decorations): a short sandstone obelisk on a
# stepped foot, gilded pyramidion, carved cat, lapis-filled ankh, eye and
# water glyphs. 0.5 x 1.0 u. Lit from the top-left: left bevel light,
# right side face in shade; incised glyphs dark on their top/left walls,
# light lip below/right. Solid.
